[{"answer":"Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm doing a survey of shoppers in Broadbeach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you have a few minutes to spare to answer some questions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... erm... yes, I guess that would be okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Everybody seems so busy today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well actually I don't have loads of time, so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/8.mp3"},{"answer":"It really won't take long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I start by taking your name please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Martyn Leigh.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Martyn's with a Y.r","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/12.mp3"},{"answer":"And is your family name spelt LEE?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/13.mp3"},{"answer":"It's LEIGH.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/15.mp3"},{"answer":"We don't actually publish your name or details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It just makes it easier for me to identify people when I look at all the results at the end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/18.mp3"},{"answer":"And can I ask, how did you get into town today?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, normally I catch the bus,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/20.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm on my motorbike today because I'm going to work later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/21.mp3"},{"answer":"And could you tell me what you're doing this morning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, the reason for your trip into town?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I've just been to the hairdresser.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/24.mp3"},{"answer":"You see, I have a job interview at the council in a few days.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh really!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, good luck with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/28.mp3"},{"answer":"And now I'm on my way to buy a suit that I can wear to the interview.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't actually own one at the moment!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that everything you're planning to do in town?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. Well, I've got to go and pick up my laptop.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/33.mp3"},{"answer":"It broke a couple of days ago so I took it to the shop to get it fixed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/34.mp3"},{"answer":"They had to order a spare part, but apparently it's ready for collection now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I can't wait to get it back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I hate it when my technology breaks down....","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/38.mp3"},{"answer":"One more thing, it's Saturday today -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/39.mp3"},{"answer":"is that when you like to do your shopping?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Well it's more a question of when I'm free.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/41.mp3"},{"answer":"If I'm free on a Monday, that's when I choose to come into town.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/42.mp3"},{"answer":"The shops are less busy then, which I always prefer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/43.mp3"},{"answer":"So, I'd like to ask you a few more questions to get your views about shopping in Broadbeach, if that's ok.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. What would you like to know specifically?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/45.mp3"},{"answer":"What would you say you like best about the shops here?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/46.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd probably say it's the service you get wherever you go.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/48.mp3"},{"answer":"And what do you think about the range of shops in Broadbeach?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, you can get almost anything you want here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/50.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about recent changes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/51.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you like and dislike about them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/52.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, there are a lot of new coffee shops now, are you enjoying them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/53.mp3"},{"answer":"No, there are too many of them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/54.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a shame as those places could be occupied by other kinds of shops.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/55.mp3"},{"answer":"What would you like to see instead?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think we have enough clothing shops.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/57.mp3"},{"answer":"But there's only one place that sells books at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/58.mp3"},{"answer":"It'd be nice to have a choice, you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And have you been to the new shopping centre outside Broadbeach yet, Martyn?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, once or twice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/62.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not that far from where I live.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/63.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a very modern-looking building, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and it's lovely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/65.mp3"},{"answer":"The glass roof is certainly impressive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/66.mp3"},{"answer":"But my favourite thing is the plants they've put around the building.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/67.mp3"},{"answer":"They're amazing, and so big already.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/68.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about the entertainment facilities?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you used any of them yet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Like the new cinema?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Nah, not yet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I can't see any advantage in having it there because the one in town is actually bigger.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, well thank you...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-1-2026-07-19-16-23-07/74.mp3"}]
